Subject: [PATCH] avcodec: submit native HEVC controls in frame mode

Correct DPB index lists, parameter IDs and PPS tool flags. Validate the
CABAC byte_alignment and escaped offset rather than rounding an RBSP bit
position. Frame-based decoders exposing slice controls receive their full
array and packed raw NAL payloads in one request; entry offsets retain the
native byte-length ABI. Submit decode mode and start-code mode on every
request, preferring START_CODE_NONE when available. Preserve legacy
slice-based buffer submission and control layouts.

